CHAPTER.VERS:
And my eye will not spare you, neither will I have pity; but I will bring your ways on you, and your disgusting behaviors will be in the midst of you: and you

          {+}
         will know that I am Yahweh.

And my eye will not spare, neither will I have pity: I will bring on you according to your ways; and your disgusting behaviors will be in the midst of you; and you

          {+}
         will know that I, Yahweh, do strike.
